de 3 dormitorios totalmente reformada en La Quinta Hills combina el diseño escandinavo con la calidez mediterránea, creando un hogar sofisticado y funcional en una de las comunidades cerradas más deseadas de Benahavís.\n\nCon tres niveles y 212 m2, la propiedad cuenta con un luminoso salón de planta abierta con cocina personalizada, electrodomésticos de primera calidad, nevera de vino y chimenea. Grandes puertas correderas conducen a una terraza privada con jardín — ideal para entretener.\n\nArriba, la suite principal ofrece vistas abiertas, un vestidor y un lujoso baño privado. Dos dormitorios adicionales y un baño de invitados bien equipado ofrecen flexibilidad para el uso de la familia, los huéspedes o la oficina en casa.\n\nEl solarium en la azotea es un verdadero punto culminante, con vistas panorámicas, el acceso es a través de escaleras internas para asegurarse de que esto es perfecto para el disfrute durante todo el año.\n\nSituado a pocos ‌minutos ‌de ‌La ‌Quinta ‌Golf, ‌Puerto Banús, ‌escuelas superiores ‌y todas las comodidades esenciales, ‌esta ‌casa ‌llave ‌en ‌mano ofrece diseño, comodidad ‌y ‌estilo ‌de ‌vida ‌en ‌igual ‌medida.","en":"This fully renovated 3-bedroom, 2.5 -bathroom townhouse in La Quinta Hills blends Scandinavian design with Mediterranean warmth, creating a sophisticated and functional home in one of Benahavís’ most desirable gated communities.\n\nSpanning three levels and 212 m², the property features a bright open-plan living area with custom designed kitchen, top quality appliances, wine fridge, and fireplace. Large sliding doors lead to a private terrace with garden, ideal for entertaining.\n\nUpstairs, the master suite offers open views, a walk-in wardrobe, and a luxurious en-suite. Two additional bedrooms and a well-appointed guest bathroom provide flexibility for family, guests, or home office use.\n\nThe rooftop solarium is a true highlight, boasting panoramic views, access is via internal stairs to make sure this is ‌perfect ‌for ‌year-round ‌enjoyment.\n\nLocated ‌just ‌minutes from ‌La Quinta ‌Golf, Puerto Banús, top schools, ‌and ‌all ‌essential ‌amenities, ‌this turnkey home delivers ‌design, ‌comfort, ‌and ‌lifestyle ‌in ‌equal ‌measure."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Suroeste","Excelente","Reformado Recientemente","Comunitaria","Aire Acondicionado","Suelo Radiante","Baño","Mar","Montaña","Panorámicas","Jardín","Urbanas","Terraza Cubierta","Armarios Empotrados","Cerca de Transporte","Terraza Privada","Barbacoa","Doble acristalamiento","Opcionales","Privado","Recinto Cerrado","Alarma","Comunitario","Lujo"],"en":["Close To Golf","Close To Shops","Close To Town","Close To Schools","South West","Excellent","Recently Renovated","Communal","Air Conditioning","U/F Heating","U/F/H Bathrooms","Sea","Mountain","Panoramic","Garden","Urban","Covered Terrace","Fitted Wardrobes","Near Transport","Private Terrace","Barbeque","Double Glazing","Optional","Private","Gated Complex","Alarm System","Communal","Luxury"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available","gps":{},"energia":{"CO2Rated":"","CO2Value":"","EnergyRated":"","EnergyValue":"","Image":""},"gastos":{"comunidad":"3,600","ibi":"597","basura":"18"}}